// docs.fasttrackstudio.app — the unified FTS docs site.
//
// `content` points at the GENERATED tree, not the authored one. Authors edit
// content/; `kf docs` renders its ```kf``` blocks to inline SVG into
// .rendered (a mirror tree), which stock dodeca then builds. Run build.sh
// (one shot) or serve.sh (watch + serve) — never `ddc` directly on raw
// source.
content .rendered
output output

// The shared engraving-font stylesheet (`kf docs` writes it; chart pages
// <link> it). Served verbatim at /kf-fonts.css — no cache-busting — so the
// stable <link href> resolves. It's CSS, so the font subsetter leaves it
// alone.
stable_assets ( kf-fonts.css )
